  "cnD": "化禄转忌是飞星体系里最容易被误读的结构之一。很多人看到化禄入财帛就开心，再看到财帛宫干飞出化忌入夫妻就慌了，以为「赚了钱就因感情破财」。实际上化禄转忌讲的是能量的流向：禄标记资源从哪里进来，忌标记这些资源最终在哪个领域形成压力或课题。两者连起来看，才是完整的因果链。",
  "enD": "A Prosperity-to-Jealousy chain is one of the most misunderstood structures in Flying-Star Zi Wei Dou Shu. People often rejoice when Prosperity enters the Wealth Palace, then panic when that palace stem flies Jealousy into the Spouse Palace, assuming money will be lost through relationships. In reality, the chain describes energy flow: Prosperity marks where resources enter, Jealousy marks where they become pressure or a lesson. Read together, they form a complete causal chain.",
  "cnL": "判断化禄转忌的第一步，是分清「生年化禄」与「宫干飞化禄」的层级。生年化禄是本命格局里固定的资源入口，一生都在那里；宫干飞化禄是某个宫位主动向外输出的能量，带有该宫的意图。两者叠加时，生年禄是底盘，飞禄是动作。第二步，看化忌落入的宫位与化禄来源宫的关系。如果禄入财帛、忌出入田宅，往往表示收入最终沉淀为固定资产或家庭开支，是「钱进来了但存不住现金」的结构；如果禄入官禄、忌出入福德，表示事业忙碌但内心消耗，需要在成就感与休息之间找平衡。第三步，看化忌落入的宫位有没有主星庙旺或其他四化支撑。庙旺主星能扛住忌的压力，把课题变成深耕的方向；落陷加煞则容易在该领域反复受挫。第四步，结合大限流年看这条链何时被引动。本命的禄忌链是长期结构，大限流年的四化叠上来时，才是事件真正发生的时间窗。",
  "enL": "The first step in reading a Prosperity-to-Jealousy chain is distinguishing natal Prosperity from palace-stem Flying Prosperity. Natal Prosperity is a fixed resource entry point in the birth chart; Flying Prosperity is a palace actively sending energy outward, carrying that palace intention. When both appear, natal Prosperity is the foundation and Flying Prosperity is the action. Second, examine the relationship between the palace Jealousy lands in and the palace Prosperity came from. If Prosperity enters Wealth and Jealousy flies to Property, income often settles into fixed assets or household spending—a \"money comes in but cash does not stay\" structure. If Prosperity enters Career and Jealousy flies to Fortune, career busyness drains inner fulfillment, requiring balance between achievement and rest. Third, check whether the palace receiving Jealousy has bright major stars or other transformations supporting it. Bright stars absorb the pressure and turn the lesson into deep expertise; fallen stars plus malefics cause repeated setbacks. Fourth, combine with Decade and Annual transformations to see when the chain activates. The natal chain is a long-term structure; events truly happen when decade or annual transformations layer on top.",
  "cnA": "举一个常见结构：生年化禄入财帛宫，财帛宫干飞出化忌入福德宫。这类人通常赚钱能力不差，收入渠道也比一般人多，但钱花在「让自己舒服」的地方特别快——兴趣爱好、情绪消费、犒劳式购物。不是守财奴型，而是「赚钱是为了过得好」的逻辑。如果福德宫本身有天同、太阴这类享受型星曜庙旺，这种消费能带来真实的满足感，是健康的；如果福德宫有煞曜或落陷，容易变成冲动消费后后悔，需要在收入到账时先做强制储蓄，再把剩余部分用于享受。另一个例子：生年化禄入官禄，官禄宫干飞忌入兄弟。这类人事业上愿意投入，也容易因为工作关系认识合作伙伴，但钱或精力容易通过合伙、平辈合作的方式流出去。适合做「自己主导、别人辅助」的结构，不适合五五平分的合伙。",
  "enA": "A common structure: natal Prosperity in Wealth Palace, whose stem flies Jealousy into Fortune Palace. These people usually earn well and have more income channels than average, but money flows quickly into comfort spending—hobbies, emotional purchases, reward-style shopping. They are not misers; their logic is \"I earn to live well.\" If Fortune Palace has bright enjoyment stars like Tong or Yin, this spending brings genuine satisfaction and is healthy. If Fortune has malefics or fallen stars, it becomes impulsive spending followed by regret, requiring automatic savings before discretionary spending. Another example: natal Prosperity in Career, whose stem flies Jealousy to Siblings. These people invest heavily in work and meet partners through career, but money and energy flow out through partnerships and peer collaborations. They thrive in \"I lead, others assist\" structures, not 50-50 partnerships.",
