  "enClose": "The core of Prosperity-to-Jealousy is not fortune or misfortune, but \"where resources come from, where they go, and where they form a lesson.\" Understanding this chain lets you arrange money destinations in advance and know where energy will drain, turning passive pressure into active planning. To see where your own Prosperity-Jealousy chain lies, start by laying out your chart and tracing it step by step."
