  "cnClose": "权忌交战的人往往比一般人更有成就潜力，因为化权给动力、化忌给深度，只是两者需要被正确安置。当你不再试图踩刹车，而是学会在该加速的地方加速、该检查的地方检查，拉扯就会变成推进力。看懂自己命盘里的权忌交战，是把内耗转化为产能的第一步。",
  "enClose": "People with Authority-Jealousy conflict often have greater achievement potential than average, because Authority provides drive and Jealousy provides depth—they just need proper placement. When you stop trying to press the brake and learn to accelerate where you should and inspect where you should, tension becomes propulsion. Understanding your own Authority-Jealousy conflict is the first step in converting internal friction into productivity."
