  "focus": "破军星坐命：破旧立新型人生。重点讲破军坐命的性格特征、变革天赋、不稳定期的管理，以及如何把「破坏」转化为「重建」。",
  "focusEn": "Po Jun (Broken Army) in the Life Palace: destroy-the-old-to-build-the-new type. This covers personality traits, transformative talent, managing unstable periods, and how to convert \"destruction\" into \"reconstruction.\"",
