  "enT": "Po Jun in the Life Palace: Transformative Personality and Life Rhythm",
  "cnD": "破军是紫微斗数中最具变革性的星曜，主破坏、创新、变动、先破后立。破军坐命的人，天生对「现状」不耐烦——旧的模式、旧的环境、旧的关系，一旦觉得不对，就想推倒重来。这种变革精神让他们成为开创新局的人，但也让他们的人生比一般人更多起伏和动荡。",
  "enD": "Po Jun (Broken Army) is the most transformative star in Zi Wei Dou Shu, governing destruction, innovation, change, and \"break first, build later.\" People with Po Jun in the Life Palace are naturally impatient with the status quo—old patterns, old environments, old relationships—once they feel something is wrong, they want to tear it down and start over. This transformative spirit makes them pioneers, but also makes their lives more turbulent than average.",
  "cnL": "破军坐命的性格特征：敢于打破常规、不喜欢重复、有冒险精神、决策果断。但也容易「为了变而变」——不是因为新的更好，而是因为旧的待腻了。破军的核心能量是「变革」，变革本身不是目的，目的是「建立更好的新秩序」。破军坐命的天赋：第一是创新能力，能看到别人看不到的新方向，适合做开拓者（创业、产品创新、组织变革）。第二是决断力，在别人犹豫的时候能快速拍板，适合在危机中做决策。第三是抗压能力，在动荡中反而能保持清醒，越乱越有斗志。破军坐命容易踩的坑：第一是「破坏有余、建设不足」——擅长推倒，但不擅长重建，推倒后不知道下一步怎么办。第二是「人际关系动荡」——因为不喜欢妥协，容易在合作中翻脸，团队稳定性差。第三是「财务大起大落」——敢冒险但不善于守成，赚得多也花得快。破军坐命的人生管理关键是「节奏和配套」。需要认识到自己的人生是「波浪式前进」的，有高潮有低谷是正常的。在「破」的阶段，要确保有足够的资源（资金、人脉、技能）支撑「立」的阶段。同时需要一个「守成型」的合作伙伴或团队来补位——你负责开创新局，别人负责稳固成果。",
  "enL": "Personality traits of Po Jun in Life Palace: dares to break conventions, dislikes repetition, adventurous, decisive. But easily \"changes for the sake of change\"—not because the new is better, but because the old has grown tiresome. Po Jun core energy is \"transformation\"; transformation itself is not the goal, the goal is \"building a better new order.\" Talents: first, innovation ability—sees new directions others miss, suitable for pioneers (entrepreneurship, product innovation, organizational change). Second, decisiveness—can make quick decisions while others hesitate, suitable for crisis decisions. Third, stress resistance—stays clear in turbulence, the more chaotic the more motivated. Common pitfalls: first, \"more destruction than construction\"—good at tearing down but not at rebuilding, does not know what to do after tearing down. Second, \"turbulent relationships\"—dislikes compromise, easily falls out with collaborators, poor team stability. Third, \"financial ups and downs\"—daring but not good at preserving wealth, earns much and spends fast. The key to life management for Po Jun is \"rhythm and support.\" Recognize that life advances in waves, with highs and lows being normal. In the \"breaking\" phase, ensure sufficient resources (funds, connections, skills) to support the \"building\" phase. Also need a \"preservation-type\" partner or team to complement—you pioneer new ground, others secure the gains.",
  "cnA": "实际案例：「日月同宫」格局的人，性格中同时有太阳的外向和太阴的内敛，表面上看起来矛盾，但实际上是「能动能静」的多面手。关键是找到能同时发挥两种特质的领域，比如需要既社交又深度思考的工作。",
  "enA": "Practical case: People with the \"Sun and Moon in Same Palace\" configuration simultaneously have Tai Yangs extroversion and Tai Yins introversion, seemingly contradictory on the surface, but actually versatile \"can move can be still.\" The key is finding a field that can leverage both traits, such as work requiring both socializing and deep thinking.",
